WEBVTT

01:42.200 --> 01:43.440
Thank you, Officer Ran.

01:43.520 --> 01:45.960
Oh, what's with all these gifts?

01:46.040 --> 01:48.480
-You shouldn't have.
-Chinese New Year is almost here.

01:49.360 --> 01:50.560
Anyway, Officer Ran,

01:52.000 --> 01:53.200
about the person named Yao Xincheng

01:54.040 --> 01:55.280
you asked about,

01:56.160 --> 01:57.480
I really don't remember anything.

01:58.480 --> 02:00.800
I never heard Uncle or Mengmeng
mention that name either.

02:00.880 --> 02:02.560
Uncle and Mengmeng
have been gone for five years now.

02:03.480 --> 02:04.960
The police also announced that.

02:05.480 --> 02:07.280
Wasn't the killer already dead?

02:07.360 --> 02:10.520
How is this still not over?

02:17.280 --> 02:20.560
If the truth hasn't come out,
how can it be over?

02:21.840 --> 02:23.320
Even if I'm gone,

02:23.840 --> 02:26.120
other police officers
will keep investigating.

02:27.360 --> 02:28.280
Right.

02:29.200 --> 02:30.400
Please think carefully again.

02:31.600 --> 02:34.920
What did Officer Ran say to you?

02:35.000 --> 02:36.560
What did he ask about?

02:37.360 --> 02:38.600
I remember

02:39.320 --> 02:41.600
Officer Ran made a phone call here.

02:41.680 --> 02:43.520
He called someone

02:43.600 --> 02:46.440
with a two-character name.
Something Qiang.

02:47.040 --> 02:47.920
Qiang?

02:49.480 --> 02:50.400
Ma Qiang…

02:50.920 --> 02:53.280
-Was it Ma Qiang?
-Yes.

02:53.360 --> 02:54.720
That's it. Ma Qiang.

02:54.800 --> 02:56.880
Ma Qiang… One moment.

02:58.480 --> 02:59.440
Right away.

03:05.640 --> 03:07.280
Alright. You can send it now.

03:07.360 --> 03:09.800
Officer Ran, other than 1997 and 2002,

03:09.880 --> 03:12.200
-do you want the rest too?
-Yes.

03:12.280 --> 03:13.360
I have those two years.

03:13.440 --> 03:15.040
Please send me the resident lists

03:15.120 --> 03:16.840
-for all the other years.
-Alright. Right away.

03:31.480 --> 03:33.320
RESIDENT LIST

03:42.520 --> 03:43.840
POLICE INTELLIGENCE MANAGEMENT SYSTEM

03:47.760 --> 03:52.920
"YAO XINCHENG" SEARCH RESULTS

03:53.000 --> 03:57.120
DAD

03:59.480 --> 04:00.320
Dad,

04:00.400 --> 04:02.840
I've searched both the internal network
and the public internet.

04:03.600 --> 04:04.960
There are all kinds of Yao Xinchengs.

04:05.040 --> 04:05.720
"YAO XINCHENG" SEARCH RESULTS

04:05.800 --> 04:06.840
Either they're not in Weiyang

04:06.920 --> 04:09.400
or they don't match Mr. Lu's description.

04:10.400 --> 04:11.600
Any leads on your side?

04:12.440 --> 04:14.720
Xu Meng's family doesn't know this person.

04:15.240 --> 04:17.120
I also asked Su Yuzhi and Lili.

04:17.200 --> 04:18.920
They don't know this name either.

04:21.480 --> 04:23.920
Qian Dajun cut the power again!

04:24.440 --> 04:27.080
Tomorrow, I'll cut his life short!

04:27.160 --> 04:28.240
Dad.

04:29.280 --> 04:31.120
Is everything alright in Yuanlongli?

04:31.800 --> 04:33.200
Is Qian Dajun starting something again?

04:33.280 --> 04:35.200
He's long gone now.

04:35.720 --> 04:37.280
After smashing the windows last night,

04:37.360 --> 04:39.280
everyone's waiting to deal with him.

04:43.640 --> 04:46.120
Kiddo, go to work tomorrow.

04:46.200 --> 04:48.400
If I find any clues here,
I'll let you know.

04:49.240 --> 04:50.720
-Hello?
-Hello?

04:52.200 --> 04:53.280
Dad?

04:54.360 --> 04:55.720
NO SERVICE

04:55.800 --> 04:57.240
Jeez.

04:58.840 --> 05:00.080
Ma Qiang.

05:01.000 --> 05:01.840
Mr. He.

05:02.760 --> 05:04.960
I called you. Why didn't you answer?

05:05.560 --> 05:08.840
I'm sorry, Mr. He.
I was with Mr. Qian all night.

05:08.920 --> 05:11.040
I didn't dare answer. What do you need?

05:11.720 --> 05:14.120
The night before New Year's Eve in 2003,

05:14.200 --> 05:16.600
did Officer Ran call you?

05:17.320 --> 05:19.880
That was so long ago.
How could I remember?

05:21.440 --> 05:23.400
The day before Ran passed away.

05:26.680 --> 05:31.200
Yes, I remember now. Officer Ran
called me then and asked

05:31.280 --> 05:32.640
for Yuanlongli's resident lists
from the past years.

05:33.240 --> 05:35.120
Later, he came
to the property office himself

05:35.200 --> 05:36.400
and even brought New Year gifts.

05:36.920 --> 05:37.840
YUANLONGLI PROPERTY MANAGEMENT

05:37.920 --> 05:40.200
Thank you, Officer Ran. You're too kind.

05:40.280 --> 05:41.360
You still remember us.

05:42.200 --> 05:43.360
Have a seat.

05:43.440 --> 05:44.560
Please sit.

05:46.080 --> 05:48.640
It's almost Chinese New Year.
You all work hard year-round.

05:49.600 --> 05:53.640
Our job can't compare to yours at all.

05:54.480 --> 05:55.680
By the way,

05:55.760 --> 05:58.520
do you remember
if there was someone in Yuanlongli

05:58.600 --> 05:59.920
named Yao Xincheng?

06:00.000 --> 06:00.760
Yao Xincheng?

06:02.160 --> 06:03.600
I really don't know.

06:04.200 --> 06:05.920
What about relatives of the residents?

06:06.520 --> 06:08.280
I know even less about that.

06:13.400 --> 06:14.280
Where's Mr. Qian?

06:14.360 --> 06:16.160
I called him several times,
but he didn't answer.

06:17.000 --> 06:19.200
Mr. Qian went out
this afternoon for business drinks.

06:19.280 --> 06:22.560
At this hour,
he's probably hammered already.

06:24.000 --> 06:25.120
Officer Ran,

06:25.200 --> 06:27.440
I'm about to head back
to my village for Chinese New Year.

06:27.520 --> 06:29.080
Wang Xinglong is on duty tomorrow.

06:29.160 --> 06:30.040
How about this?

06:30.560 --> 06:32.520
I'll leave a note for Mr. Qian.

06:32.600 --> 06:34.600
When he sees it, he'll call you back.

06:35.400 --> 06:36.320
Alright.

06:36.400 --> 06:37.800
-Thank you.
-You're welcome.

06:40.360 --> 06:41.280
Officer Ran.

06:42.400 --> 06:45.800
You mentioned this Yao Xincheng.

06:45.880 --> 06:48.440
Does he have anything to do
with Yuanlongli?

06:56.040 --> 06:58.800
If he has nothing to do
with Yuanlongli either,

07:00.040 --> 07:02.560
then I don't know where I can go next.

07:07.320 --> 07:08.320
And then?

07:08.400 --> 07:09.520
And then…

07:10.520 --> 07:12.000
That was all.

07:12.520 --> 07:16.000
When Officer Ran left,
he looked pretty disappointed.

07:22.560 --> 07:23.680
I never thought

07:24.840 --> 07:28.320
that would be the last time I saw him.

08:14.800 --> 08:15.480
RAN FANGXU'S PATH

08:15.560 --> 08:16.400
Say, sir,

08:16.480 --> 08:18.680
do you remember the blue leather heels
from the June 30th case?

08:18.760 --> 08:21.200
The blue leather heels
were tall and eye-catching.

08:21.280 --> 08:22.240
They were definitely real.

08:22.320 --> 08:23.160
BLUE LEATHER HEELS
LILI

08:23.240 --> 08:24.080
DU MINGLIANG'S MOTHER

08:24.160 --> 08:26.720
You should ask those who sell fake shoes.

08:26.800 --> 08:28.400
They would definitely know.

08:28.480 --> 08:31.040
Judging by the finish and workmanship,

08:31.120 --> 08:33.720
that should be the work
of Mr. Lu from Pingzhao County.

08:34.320 --> 08:36.600
It was a perfectly real pair of shoes,
yet he insisted I make them look fake.

08:37.200 --> 08:38.640
He was a man in his thirties.

08:38.720 --> 08:39.679
SHOEMAKER MR. LU
MAN WITH THREE CIGARETTE BURN MARKS

08:39.760 --> 08:42.440
He had three burn marks on his arm.

08:43.760 --> 08:45.880
There's a loose thread here.

08:45.960 --> 08:46.960
How did I never notice it before?

08:47.040 --> 08:47.720
BOWLS DRESS

08:47.800 --> 08:49.320
According to the dry-cleaning records,

08:49.400 --> 08:53.040
the buyer of this dress
was named Yao Xincheng.

08:53.560 --> 08:56.240
If he has nothing to do with Yuanlongli,

08:56.320 --> 08:59.200
then I don't know where I can go next.

09:18.520 --> 09:19.560
Ran.

09:22.560 --> 09:25.240
How did you continue the investigation?

09:51.000 --> 09:52.000
Sir,

09:53.360 --> 09:54.760
if you were me,

09:55.800 --> 09:57.480
how would you continue the investigation?

11:37.720 --> 11:42.720
WEIYANG PUBLIC SECURITY BUREAU
NANSHAN BRANCH

11:42.800 --> 11:46.880
LOYAL AND TRUE

11:50.600 --> 11:51.560
Hello, Dad?

11:51.640 --> 11:53.120
What did you find?

11:53.200 --> 11:56.480
-I'm going home.
-What? Not investigating anymore?

11:56.560 --> 11:58.960
I was thinking
I would come to your place after work.

11:59.560 --> 12:00.920
The trail went cold.

12:01.520 --> 12:03.840
I don't want to stay stuck
in Yuanlongli anymore.

12:03.920 --> 12:04.960
I'll head home

12:05.560 --> 12:07.080
and think about the next move.

12:07.920 --> 12:08.880
Alright then.

12:08.960 --> 12:10.960
I'll help you move after work.

12:11.480 --> 12:13.960
No need. You take care of your work.

12:14.040 --> 12:16.720
I can handle these myself.

12:17.920 --> 12:19.160
Dad,

12:19.760 --> 12:20.800
are you alright?

12:22.640 --> 12:24.600
Why wouldn't I be?

12:26.800 --> 12:28.360
Just focus on your job.

12:28.440 --> 12:31.880
If I find any new clues,
I'll tell you right away.

12:32.960 --> 12:37.520
Don't worry. In my life,
there's no such word as giving up.

12:38.120 --> 12:39.040
I'm hanging up.

13:29.200 --> 13:30.120
Coming.

13:35.200 --> 13:36.160
Who is it?

13:39.240 --> 13:40.800
Officer He, morning.

13:41.800 --> 13:44.640
Manager Ma sent me over
to bring you hot water.

13:45.960 --> 13:47.120
There's no need.

13:47.200 --> 13:49.120
I'm moving out soon anyway.

13:51.360 --> 13:52.680
Are you moving out?

13:54.320 --> 13:55.240
That's great.

13:55.320 --> 13:56.840
I'll give you a hand.

13:56.920 --> 13:59.120
No need. You go get busy.

14:03.200 --> 14:05.200
RAN FANGXU'S PATH

14:08.160 --> 14:10.040
Poor Officer Ran.

14:12.640 --> 14:14.000
Speaking of that,

14:14.520 --> 14:17.520
before he passed, I saw him one last time.

14:22.440 --> 14:23.280
Then…

14:24.440 --> 14:25.520
What did you say?

14:28.880 --> 14:30.760
You saw him? When?

14:30.840 --> 14:32.800
On New Year's Eve morning.

14:33.520 --> 14:34.640
In this building.

14:44.680 --> 14:45.880
Who the heck is that?

14:47.400 --> 14:48.560
I'm sorry, Wang Xinglong.

14:49.160 --> 14:50.000
Officer Ran?

14:50.080 --> 14:51.240
It's alright.

14:51.320 --> 14:53.040
You really startled me.

14:54.080 --> 14:55.840
When he came out of the elevator,
he scared me.

14:56.360 --> 14:57.400
His eyes were bloodshot.

14:57.480 --> 14:58.840
He clearly didn't sleep all night.

14:58.920 --> 15:00.520
Then he rushed off in a hurry.

15:01.120 --> 15:03.600
Must've been heading off
to something urgent.

15:09.040 --> 15:11.200
Are you sure
it was New Year's Eve morning?

15:12.920 --> 15:15.000
I'm sure. Eight in the morning.

15:15.520 --> 15:16.720
It was a property management rule.

15:16.800 --> 15:19.160
Eight a.m. Patrol the building at 8 a.m.

15:20.880 --> 15:21.800
DRAFT, UNSENT MESSAGE

15:21.880 --> 15:23.240
SAVED TIME: 2003-01-31
13:09:37, RECIPIENT: SIR

15:23.320 --> 15:24.720
RAN: SIR, THE JUNE 30TH CASE IS WRONG
THE WHOLE THING IS WRONG

15:33.240 --> 15:34.120
Thank you.

15:34.200 --> 15:36.040
You did me a big favor.

15:38.680 --> 15:40.520
Wait, Mr. He… Weren't you moving out?

15:40.600 --> 15:41.440
Why are you moving things back in?

15:41.520 --> 15:43.960
I'm not moving anymore.
Absolutely not moving.

15:44.960 --> 15:47.920
By the way,
go find Qian Dajun now and tell him

15:48.600 --> 15:50.800
I'm staying in Yuanlongli,
and I'll fight him to the end.

15:52.680 --> 15:54.080
That's a snap decision.

16:02.680 --> 16:05.480
Ran met with Ma Qiang

16:05.560 --> 16:07.600
the night before New Year's Eve.

16:09.440 --> 16:11.280
Then on New Year's Eve morning,

16:11.360 --> 16:13.200
he ran out of the building again.

16:14.920 --> 16:16.760
His eyes were red with exhaustion.

16:17.680 --> 16:21.040
That afternoon, he drafted a message to me

16:21.560 --> 16:24.080
saying the June 30th case was all wrong.

16:26.440 --> 16:28.320
He must have found something.

16:29.840 --> 16:32.280
He must have found something
in this building.

16:32.360 --> 16:33.200
CRIMINAL CASE STUDIES

16:36.120 --> 16:38.280
RAN FANGXU'S PATH

16:40.680 --> 16:41.720
Ran,

16:42.320 --> 16:44.240
what did you find?

17:21.880 --> 17:24.480
SIR

17:44.000 --> 17:47.880
In four hours,
we'll welcome the Chinese New Year.

17:47.960 --> 17:49.800
On the last night
before the fresh new year,

17:49.880 --> 17:53.920
are you, listening to the radio,
on your way to reunite with your family?

17:57.000 --> 18:00.760
BLESSING

18:22.040 --> 18:23.880
Why won't he answer?

18:26.880 --> 18:28.320
Dad, don't worry.

18:28.400 --> 18:30.760
Uncle Ran has probably gone
to pick up Ms. Qiao.

18:32.600 --> 18:34.200
See? Here they are.

18:35.160 --> 18:36.200
Coming.

18:39.720 --> 18:40.960
-Qiao.
-Officer He.

18:41.040 --> 18:42.080
Ms. Qiao.

18:42.160 --> 18:43.800
-Xiaohe.
-Come in.

18:43.880 --> 18:44.560
Sure.

18:45.480 --> 18:46.880
Ran didn't come with you?

18:48.760 --> 18:51.480
I thought something had come up
at work and kept him busy.

18:51.560 --> 18:54.200
He was supposed to pick me up from work.

18:54.280 --> 18:56.800
I waited, and he never showed.

18:56.880 --> 18:57.840
He didn't answer my calls either.

18:57.920 --> 18:59.400
I was worried
you would all be waiting too long,

18:59.480 --> 19:01.520
so I took a taxi here.

19:03.080 --> 19:04.320
That brat.

19:04.400 --> 19:06.320
What is he busy with on New Year's Eve?

19:06.400 --> 19:09.240
Maybe he left his phone back at work.

19:09.920 --> 19:12.360
It's raining hard outside today.
The roads are bad.

19:12.440 --> 19:13.680
Let's wait for him.

19:14.640 --> 19:16.200
Alright. Let's go inside.

19:17.520 --> 19:19.800
Officer He, I'm not good at picking gifts,

19:19.880 --> 19:21.440
so I brought some supplements.

19:22.240 --> 19:23.080
Just having you here is enough.

19:23.160 --> 19:24.760
You don't have to bring
anything next time.

19:24.840 --> 19:26.840
Xiaohe, help Ms. Qiao change clothes

19:26.920 --> 19:27.880
-and get her a pair of slippers.
-Okay.

19:27.960 --> 19:29.360
I'll finish wrapping dumplings.

19:29.440 --> 19:32.120
-Ms. Qiao, here.
-Thank you.

19:35.000 --> 19:36.320
Come. New Year's gift.

19:39.960 --> 19:42.160
We have the same scarf.
Thank you, Ms. Qiao.

19:42.240 --> 19:43.280
You're welcome.

19:45.600 --> 19:46.760
Have a seat.

19:46.840 --> 19:47.680
Sure.

19:49.320 --> 19:51.480
This scarf matches my hairstyle perfectly.

19:52.200 --> 19:55.120
By the way,
did Uncle Ran get you a gift too?

19:58.200 --> 19:59.280
Oh…

19:59.960 --> 20:01.760
Looks like the answer is obvious.

20:06.760 --> 20:07.840
Officer He, I'll help.

20:09.360 --> 20:10.720
Alright. Good to have extra hands.

20:15.960 --> 20:16.800
Qiao,

20:17.800 --> 20:20.480
my apprentice is good in every way.

20:21.080 --> 20:22.320
Stable job.

20:22.840 --> 20:24.440
Good character.

20:24.520 --> 20:26.000
Only one flaw.

20:26.640 --> 20:29.200
Other than solving cases,
he never takes the initiative in anything.

20:31.040 --> 20:35.080
You see, as his mentor,
when it comes to marriage,

20:35.160 --> 20:37.120
I can count as half a parent.

20:38.600 --> 20:39.640
Look,

20:39.720 --> 20:41.040
Xiaohe likes you so much.

20:42.040 --> 20:44.720
Our big family here
just happens to be missing one person.

20:44.800 --> 20:47.080
We genuinely hope
you'll become that person.

20:47.960 --> 20:49.280
That's right, Ms. Qiao.

20:49.360 --> 20:52.320
From the first time I met you,
I felt like you would become family.

20:52.920 --> 20:54.240
Once Uncle Ran gets here,

20:54.320 --> 20:56.640
I'm calling you Mrs. Ran.

20:58.720 --> 20:59.560
Qiao,

20:59.640 --> 21:01.600
no matter how things develop
between you and Ran later,

21:02.200 --> 21:04.640
fast or slow, that's between you two.

21:04.720 --> 21:05.640
I won't interfere.

21:05.720 --> 21:07.280
But one thing I'll say first.

21:07.360 --> 21:09.680
This home will be your home from now on.

21:10.600 --> 21:13.160
We gather like this
every holiday and festival.

21:42.160 --> 21:44.800
In a little while,
the New Year bell will ring.

21:45.400 --> 21:46.680
I should make a wish.

21:47.280 --> 21:48.960
I wish our whole family

21:49.480 --> 21:52.960
happiness and many blessings.

21:57.080 --> 21:58.120
Thank you,

21:58.640 --> 21:59.480
Officer He.

22:00.080 --> 22:01.520
Thank you, Xiaohe.

22:02.480 --> 22:04.840
And even more, I should thank Ran.

22:06.360 --> 22:07.600
Thank you all

22:08.760 --> 22:10.600
for making me feel
what having a family is like.

22:11.320 --> 22:12.760
That's my wish too.

22:14.480 --> 22:15.680
My New Year's wish.

22:18.680 --> 22:19.720
Why thank us?

22:20.240 --> 22:22.440
From now on, we're family.

22:22.520 --> 22:23.880
No need for thanks between family.

22:24.400 --> 22:25.520
Exactly.

22:25.600 --> 22:27.640
No worries there, Mrs. Ran.

22:28.680 --> 22:32.040
I want love to live in my home every day

22:32.120 --> 22:33.480
Day and night

22:33.560 --> 22:35.440
Through all four seasons

22:35.520 --> 22:37.040
With our hearts

22:37.120 --> 22:38.880
Loving our home

22:38.960 --> 22:42.280
I want love to live in your home every day

22:42.360 --> 22:45.600
I want love to live in my home every day

22:45.680 --> 22:47.240
Filled with joy

22:47.320 --> 22:49.520
Safe and blessed

22:49.600 --> 22:50.960
Love stays in our home

22:51.040 --> 22:51.720
RAN

22:51.800 --> 22:55.360
Forever

23:30.400 --> 23:34.640
SIR

24:04.400 --> 24:06.240
It's mainly because of the oil drums.

24:07.120 --> 24:08.880
Recheck the scene.

24:10.800 --> 24:13.320
Director Zou, this belongs to Captain Ran.

24:16.760 --> 24:18.080
It's burned in the fire.

24:19.800 --> 24:22.360
There are no cameras on this road.

24:23.120 --> 24:24.680
Based on our initial investigation,

24:25.200 --> 24:27.720
the accident was likely caused
by poorly stored materials

24:27.800 --> 24:29.560
at this construction site.

24:30.560 --> 24:32.560
Strong wind knocked over two fuel drums.

24:33.120 --> 24:34.280
It was raining hard and dark outside.

24:35.640 --> 24:37.080
Oil spilled onto the road,
making it slippery.

24:38.280 --> 24:41.400
When the vehicle passed through,
it would've been hard to keep control.

24:42.000 --> 24:44.240
That's why Captain Ran…

24:46.520 --> 24:48.160
Coordinate with the criminal department.

24:48.760 --> 24:50.360
You must get to the bottom of this.

24:53.200 --> 24:54.920
He was a good coworker

24:55.000 --> 24:56.520
and a good comrade.

24:58.840 --> 25:00.160
It's heartbreaking.

25:10.080 --> 25:11.400
Uncle Ran!

25:12.000 --> 25:13.320
Uncle Ran!

25:13.400 --> 25:14.720
-Uncle Ran!
-Xiaohe.

25:15.520 --> 25:16.880
Don't go over there.

25:16.960 --> 25:20.560
Don't. Xiaohe, don't go over there.

29:00.560 --> 29:01.720
Ran.

29:04.960 --> 29:06.160
It's Chinese New Year.

29:18.680 --> 29:19.680
It's Chinese New Year.

29:32.080 --> 29:33.880
Wishing everyone a Happy Chinese New Year!

29:33.960 --> 29:35.680
-Wish you a happy Year of the Goat!
-Happy New Year!

29:35.760 --> 29:37.640
Happy Chinese New Year!

29:37.720 --> 29:40.440
Dear friends, at this exciting moment,

29:40.520 --> 29:42.440
we send to people
of all ethnic groups across the nation,

29:42.520 --> 29:44.120
to our compatriots

29:44.200 --> 29:45.160
in Hong Kong, China,
Macau Special Administrative Region,

29:45.240 --> 29:48.280
Taiwan, China, and to Chinese people
all around the world

29:48.360 --> 29:49.200
our New Year greetings.

29:49.280 --> 29:52.800
Crossing the threshold of time,
we step into the embrace of spring.

29:52.880 --> 29:54.960
Happy Spring Festival!

30:13.520 --> 30:18.160
RAN FANGXU, MALE, CREMATION IN PROGRESS

30:18.240 --> 30:21.760
IN PROGRESS

30:25.440 --> 30:27.600
IN MOURNING

30:50.240 --> 30:51.880
Xiaohe, where are you going?

31:10.960 --> 31:12.760
-I win.
-That's your…

31:12.840 --> 31:14.160
Someone's here.

31:14.240 --> 31:16.160
LANYA HAIR SALON

31:16.240 --> 31:18.320
FULL SALON SERVICES
CUTS, COLORS &amp; STYLES

31:18.400 --> 31:19.960
We're closed today.

31:22.040 --> 31:23.280
I need a haircut.

31:37.120 --> 31:37.960
Xiaohe.

31:38.600 --> 31:39.960
Say hi to Uncle Ran.

31:41.000 --> 31:42.440
Hello, Xiaohe.

31:47.160 --> 31:48.520
This is for you.

31:48.600 --> 31:49.920
Thank you, Uncle Ran.

31:58.280 --> 31:59.960
Let go of me. I'm not going with you.

32:00.040 --> 32:02.120
I even treated you as my best friend!

32:05.480 --> 32:07.720
Xiaohe, I owe you an apology.

32:07.800 --> 32:11.640
The way you acted in the traffickers' van
was brave and smart.

32:11.720 --> 32:13.280
You surely are cut out for a detective.

32:16.920 --> 32:18.640
From now on, you teach me music notation,

32:18.720 --> 32:19.960
I teach you criminal investigation.

32:20.040 --> 32:21.040
We'll learn from each other.

32:21.640 --> 32:23.880
-Deal.
-Deal.

32:44.040 --> 32:46.160
RAN 1972-2003

33:02.680 --> 33:07.760
TOMB OF RAN FANGXU

33:07.840 --> 33:08.880
First bow.

33:13.520 --> 33:14.360
Second bow.

33:24.920 --> 33:25.840
Third bow.

33:41.440 --> 33:42.520
Uncle Ran.

36:25.760 --> 36:27.040
Hello. My surname is Ran.

36:27.120 --> 36:29.280
-Ran as in rising upward.
-This is my apprentice.

36:29.360 --> 36:30.480
I'm not.

36:31.600 --> 36:32.280
He's not my mentor.

36:33.280 --> 36:34.560
Let me say this again.

36:34.640 --> 36:35.680
I am not your apprentice.

36:38.680 --> 36:39.600
He Yuanhang!

36:39.680 --> 36:41.000
I got him! He Yuanhang.

36:41.080 --> 36:42.840
He Yuanhang,
you're not fit to be a detective!

36:42.920 --> 36:43.880
MISSING PERSON

36:51.800 --> 36:54.800
I'll follow your lead.
Let's do the plan you talked about.

36:54.880 --> 36:57.360
This time, you're the one who begged me.

36:58.040 --> 36:59.120
Aren't we partners?

37:00.520 --> 37:02.840
Look at you.
You work pretty well together.

37:16.320 --> 37:17.520
He!

37:18.360 --> 37:19.480
He!

37:21.240 --> 37:22.120
He!

37:22.640 --> 37:24.400
Don't sleep, He.

37:24.480 --> 37:26.120
Comrade He Yuanhang, you're hereby awarded

37:26.200 --> 37:27.640
Second-class Merit for Individual Service.

37:40.760 --> 37:41.960
I'm leaving,

37:42.920 --> 37:43.880
sir.

37:53.600 --> 37:54.520
Kiddo.

37:56.080 --> 37:57.600
I only ask one thing of you.

37:58.600 --> 37:59.600
Dad,

38:00.320 --> 38:01.240
say no more.

38:02.160 --> 38:05.200
After the holiday,
I'll go back to school and study.

38:05.800 --> 38:06.720
I'll apply to the police academy

38:07.600 --> 38:08.840
and become a detective.

38:09.440 --> 38:10.520
I'll solve cases

38:11.600 --> 38:13.000
and finish the shifts

38:13.760 --> 38:16.040
for you all that you never got to finish.

38:24.480 --> 38:27.800
TOMB OF RAN FANGXU

38:27.880 --> 38:29.040
Uncle Ran,

38:29.920 --> 38:31.360
I'm not going to Beijing anymore.

38:32.320 --> 38:35.880
No matter how cold or heavy something is,

38:36.400 --> 38:38.160
I'll carry it myself.

38:38.240 --> 38:40.200
I'll carry it all by myself.

39:18.040 --> 39:21.520
WEIYANG PUBLIC SECURITY BUREAU
NANSHAN BRANCH

39:23.280 --> 39:26.160
Wang Xinglong said
the night before New Year's Eve,

39:26.240 --> 39:28.560
Ran stayed in New York Block
the whole night.

39:28.640 --> 39:32.240
He must've found
some crucial information or a clue.

39:32.320 --> 39:34.320
That's why the next day
he wrote that message.

39:36.200 --> 39:38.520
I'm not leaving this building.

39:39.120 --> 39:41.720
I'll ask Captain Zhao
to reopen the June 30th case.

39:42.240 --> 39:45.040
We'll reopen it, but now isn't the time.

39:45.120 --> 39:46.400
We don't have key evidence.

39:46.480 --> 39:49.600
Especially this crucial person,
Yao Xincheng.

39:49.680 --> 39:50.920
We haven't found him yet.

39:51.520 --> 39:52.560
Luckily,

39:52.640 --> 39:55.720
Ran narrowed the final clue
down to Yuanlongli.

39:56.360 --> 39:58.120
-I'll investigate with you.
-No need.

39:58.200 --> 40:00.160
If we go together, we'll draw attention.

40:00.240 --> 40:02.720
It'll be easier if I work alone.

40:02.800 --> 40:04.160
Get the application papers ready now.

40:04.240 --> 40:05.960
Once I make progress here,

40:06.040 --> 40:09.640
go to Zhao Jie and have him coordinate
a delay to Yuanlongli's demolition.

40:10.560 --> 40:11.440
Also…

40:13.680 --> 40:14.960
Hello? Hello?

40:15.040 --> 40:16.080
Hello?

40:17.920 --> 40:18.960
Lousy signal.

40:20.000 --> 40:21.360
NO SERVICE

40:23.240 --> 40:24.200
Jeez.

40:24.920 --> 40:26.320
No signal again.

40:42.520 --> 40:43.800
Mr. He,

40:43.880 --> 40:45.200
you went back on your word.

40:45.280 --> 40:47.000
You said you would move out
before demolition.

40:47.080 --> 40:48.200
You let down my trust.

40:49.480 --> 40:50.320
Good timing.

40:50.400 --> 40:53.920
Didn't you want me to move out early?
Find a person for me.

40:54.840 --> 40:57.600
Ask around whether anyone
named Yao Xincheng

40:57.680 --> 41:00.560
was living in Yuanlongli around 1997.

41:00.640 --> 41:03.120
Or anyone who knows this person.

41:03.880 --> 41:05.080
-Yao Xincheng?
-Right.

41:06.560 --> 41:09.200
Never heard of any Yao Xincheng.

41:09.800 --> 41:12.000
Mr. He, tell me honestly.

41:12.080 --> 41:13.360
You refuse to leave here

41:13.440 --> 41:15.640
because you want to investigate
the case from 1997 again?

41:16.560 --> 41:18.480
Are you acting up again?

41:19.400 --> 41:20.680
My mind is perfectly fine.

41:20.760 --> 41:22.400
Don't listen to their nonsense.

41:23.120 --> 41:24.720
Seems like you're still not quite right.

41:26.320 --> 41:31.200
Mr. He, Officer Ran and you
solved the Yuanlongli case twice.

41:31.840 --> 41:33.200
You even got a commendation
the second time.

41:33.280 --> 41:36.160
Are you trying to overturn it
and solve it a third time?

41:36.680 --> 41:39.400
Until the truth is found,
forget a third time.

41:39.480 --> 41:40.840
A fourth time. A fifth time.

41:40.920 --> 41:43.080
Even if it takes a hundred times,
I'll keep digging.

41:44.240 --> 41:46.720
This is the task
Ran left me before he died.

41:46.800 --> 41:48.160
If I can't finish it,

41:48.240 --> 41:50.640
I won't have the face
to meet him down there.

41:54.240 --> 41:57.320
This was Officer Ran's last wish?

41:57.400 --> 41:58.520
Right.

42:05.280 --> 42:07.360
For someone as good as Officer Ran,

42:08.120 --> 42:10.440
I'll help with this.

42:11.040 --> 42:15.320
Tell me. Aside from Yao Xincheng,
what else do you need me to do?

42:17.400 --> 42:20.680
Can you restore
the signal, water, and electricity?

42:20.760 --> 42:22.520
-Alright.
-By the way,

42:22.600 --> 42:26.880
if possible, tell Qian Dajun
not to start demolition early.

42:27.640 --> 42:28.720
I'll do everything I can to help.

42:29.360 --> 42:32.120
Qian Dajun is downstairs.
Wait for my news.

42:32.200 --> 42:34.040
Okay?

42:47.960 --> 42:52.720
ROUND 4 OF THE TRÉMAUX ALGORITHM
ON THE YUANLONGLI CASE

43:09.000 --> 43:09.960
HOLDOUTS GROUP

43:10.040 --> 43:11.640
DU: MR. HE, HURRY OVER!

43:12.960 --> 43:14.280
DU

43:14.360 --> 43:16.600
Mr. He, help me! Get to the cybercafé now!

43:20.000 --> 43:22.720
This man…

43:22.800 --> 43:24.360
OPTICAL

43:24.440 --> 43:25.640
Brat,

43:26.600 --> 43:28.080
listen up.

43:28.640 --> 43:30.000
Move aside right now.

43:30.840 --> 43:32.400
My patience is running out.

43:33.160 --> 43:36.040
Don't come over! Don't come over!

43:36.680 --> 43:37.400
I'll count to three.

43:38.560 --> 43:40.080
If you don't move,

43:40.160 --> 43:41.520
I'll tear down this darned building
with you in it.

43:41.600 --> 43:43.000
I'll stand with my shop.

43:43.080 --> 43:45.560
If you dare come closer,
I'll take you down with me!

43:46.840 --> 43:48.040
One.

43:48.680 --> 43:49.960
Two.

43:51.440 --> 43:52.600
-Three.
-Qian Dajun,

43:53.440 --> 43:55.280
what you're doing now counts as a crime.

43:55.360 --> 43:56.520
Get down here.

43:57.640 --> 43:58.800
Crazy old fool.

43:59.320 --> 44:01.000
Still think you're a cop?

44:03.360 --> 44:04.880
HAIR SALON

44:09.200 --> 44:10.480
I'm fighting you today!

44:10.560 --> 44:12.240
Come on then. Don't stop me, Mr. He!

44:12.320 --> 44:13.520
I'll hack him to death!

44:15.320 --> 44:16.680
Don't stop me, Mr. He!

44:16.760 --> 44:17.640
I'll kill him!

44:17.720 --> 44:20.400
Don't stop me, Mr. He! I'll kill him!

44:22.640 --> 44:24.000
I'll kill you!

44:24.080 --> 44:25.200
Qian Dajun,

44:25.280 --> 44:26.760
-I'll kill you!
-Darn it.

44:28.400 --> 44:29.880
-My fence!
-I'm demolishing them all.

44:29.960 --> 44:31.000
You bastard!

44:31.080 --> 44:31.920
Qian Dajun!

44:32.000 --> 44:32.960
Brat.

44:33.040 --> 44:34.480
Don't stop me, Mr. He.

44:35.120 --> 44:36.800
Let me go, Mr. He.

44:36.880 --> 44:38.200
I'll kill you!

44:38.280 --> 44:39.360
My shop!

44:40.680 --> 44:42.160
Taking me down with you?

44:42.240 --> 44:44.440
You and your bunker will go down together.

44:44.520 --> 44:45.200
GOOD NEIGHBOR TAILOR SHOP, ALTERATIONS

44:50.960 --> 44:53.680
-I'm done with you!
-Let go. Let go.

44:53.760 --> 44:54.680
Jeez.

45:03.080 --> 45:06.200
He is so cruel.

45:06.280 --> 45:08.720
Mr. He. Dead… Dead body…

45:12.600 --> 45:14.120
-What's wrong?
-Oh my goodness.

45:16.880 --> 45:19.480
What happened?

45:19.560 --> 45:20.800
What happened?

45:22.000 --> 45:23.920
So scaring!

45:24.000 --> 45:27.360
-What is this?
-It's a cement bollard.
